<title>USA: Government Technology CFO resigns.</title>
<headline>Government Technology CFO resigns.</headline>
<dateline>CHANTILLY, Va. 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Government Technology Services Inc said Tuesday that its chief financial officer, Peter Janke, has resigned.</p>
<p>Janke is leaving the company to &quot;pursue other interests,&quot; the company said in a statement.</p>
<p>Vice President and Controller Chuck Hasper is to assume Janke's duties on an acting basis, the company said.</p>
</text>
